    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1781" n="1741" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v09p1/pg1741"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v09p1">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1952–1954, Volume IX, Part
                        1, The Near East and Middle East</ref>. Please be aware that printed volumes
                    have not been revised. <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d653-f2">Document 653, Footnote 2,
                                Page 1295</ref> (date of correction: May 7, 2019)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The reference to “Oliver Gass” is in error. It has been corrected to read
                        “Oscar Gass.”</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. <ref target="#persons">List of Persons</ref> (date
                            of correction: May 7, 2019)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The entry for “Gass, Oliver” has been corrected to read “Gass,
                        Oscar.”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
